From 9fd814c2007f81a1364274d33bbec50c9055fdb8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 01:32:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Keyboard check: every testers' text box stays wholly
 above a phone keyboard (30-60%), with a planted failure; the name box kept
 too

- ControlTestGate.tsx useAboveKeyboard: the field with its count kept 24 px above the keyboard on focus,
  input and every visualViewport resize/scroll; the name, looked-wrong and note boxes all use it.
- tools/perf/kbdcheck.mjs: 412x915 with 30/40/50% keyboards, 915x412 with 50/60%; each field focused and
  after three typed lines; the box and count inside the visible part, top not off-screen, bottom >= 16 px
  over the keyboard. Planted: keep-in-view off must go red. In gates.yml; gates.md row.
- Stills in reference/qa/tester-page-1106/keyboard/. Locally: 30 of 30 pass, the plant goes red.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FhBbYJYzHh5qAsNs8q9u9d
